      "content": "it just feels so much more noble that way, you know? like, if i stay, i'm just waiting to screw up or pass it on to a kid or something, and then the whole mess just keeps going. but if i stop it now, i'm actually doing something good for once. i'm protecting them from the version of me that's destined to fail. it's like the only way i can actually be a hero in my own family is to make sure the cycle dies with me.",
